# D3-SO-006: Iodide changes iodine availability without being extra iodine molecules
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 water 30mL
add v1 I2 0.0003mol
add v1 KI 0.003mol
add v2 water 30mL
add v2 I2 0.0003mol
add v2 KCl 0.003mol
stir v1 300rpm 30s
stir v2 300rpm 30s
measure v1 uvvis
measure v2 uvvis
look v1
look v2
particles v1
particles v2
inspect
